\end{equation*}
Rounding both sides down to the nearest integers, and utilizing the fact that $N - |D^{\textup{OL}}_t| - |D^{{{\sysbar{\pi}}^*}}_t|$ and $\alpha N$ are integers, we get \eqref{eq:pf-subroutine-conf:interm-goal-1}. Similarly, to show \eqref{eq:pf-subroutine-conf:interm-goal-2}, observe that $|D^{{{\sysbar{\pi}}^*}}_t| \leq \alpha (N - |D^{\textup{OL}}_t|)$, so 
\[
