\label{lem:opt-gap-linear-comp}
   Suppose that the LP relaxation \eqref{eq:lp-single} has a unique optimal solution $y^*$, and $y^*(s,1) + y^*(s,0) > 0,$ $\forall s\in\mathbb{S}$. Then 
   \vspace{-8pt}
