where to get \eqref{eq:lb:apply-rate-conservation}, we use the fact that  $\Eplain{\sum_{s'\in\mathbb{S}}P(S_\infty(i),A_\infty(i),s')f(s')}=\Eplain{f(S_\infty(i))}$ for any function $f\colon\mathbb{S}\to\mathbb{R}$.

