    &= \sqrt{1+\epsilon_1'} \norm{v}_{U_{+}}.
\end{align*}
Letting $\epsilon_1 = \sqrt{1+\epsilon_1'} - 1$, we obtain \eqref{eq:Uus-expansion}. 

Next, we prove \eqref{eq:Uus-expansion-max}. 
